mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">발굴된 기업체</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;\">애로기술들을 학생들의 창의적인 아이디어로 <b>교수</b></span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span></b><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-1.1pt;\"><b>기업체가 공동</b>으로 <b>문제해결 및 시제품 제작</b>을 통해 창의역량 및 실무능력 향상</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; text-indent: -26.3pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">☞ </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;letter-spacing:-0.5pt;\">우수한 문제해결 과제에 대하여 공동 <b>특허출원 및 기술이전</b>을 통해 지식재산권 역량 제고</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">개 요</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">접수 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">: 21. 08. 30(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">) ~ 09.07(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;color:#d80f0f;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">추진 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: <b>21. 09. 13(</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) ~ 2021. 12. 31(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">금</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><b>)</b> : 3</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">개월</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">참가 대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">본교 재학생 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">팀당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3~5</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">명으로 구성하여 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">주</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;\">관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-f